{"4542840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "COOKBOT", "steam_appid": 4542840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COOKBOT is an atmospheric narrative game about cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be mixing, cutting, cooking, baking, pouring and freezing different foods to fulfill food orders given to you by the crew of the space ship ZIMA on route through deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crew will talk to you about all sorts of things. They might treat you differently. They might treat each other differently. No matter what they say, you are to provide them what they ordered. If not, the on-board vending machine is a suitable replacement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was co-financed by the Croatian Audiovisual Centre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542840/extras/e52fb3209be375b51ebf62d44f8cf7ea.avif?t=1787153604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542840/extras_big/e52fb3209be375b51ebf62d44f8cf7ea.webp?t=1787153604 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COOKBOT is an atmospheric narrative game about cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be mixing, cutting, cooking, baking, pouring and freezing different foods to fulfill food orders given to you by the crew of the space ship ZIMA on route through deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crew will talk to you about all sorts of things. They might treat you differently. They might treat each other differently. No matter what they say, you are to provide them what they ordered. If not, the on-board vending machine is a suitable replacement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was co-financed by the Croatian Audiovisual Centre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542840/extras/e52fb3209be375b51ebf62d44f8cf7ea.avif?t=1787153604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542840/extras_big/e52fb3209be375b51ebf62d44f8cf7ea.webp?t=1787153604 width=1560 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You've been placed as a standard model COOKBOT on the transit ship Zima. Cook, bake, pour, freeze, cut and mix food while following recipes. Complete orders from crew members. Pay no mind to what they say - you're not human. The cake is there for company morale.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542840/d00c6c14db4b61f3dfede8f31f0bce9adb9a7563/header.jpg?t=1787153604", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542840/3919037563dde425d5c5e5e9fe900e549fb1ddf0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787153604", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542840/3919037563dde425d5c5e5e9fe900e549fb1ddf0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787153604", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6300HQ (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-1135G7 (or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RA